---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro'; import J from '../../components/J.astro';
export { paths as getStaticPaths } from '../../data/paths';
import { projects } from '../../data/projects';
const { lang } = Astro.params; const ja = lang==='ja';
const _b = import.meta.env.BASE_URL; const B = _b.endsWith('/') ? _b.slice(0, -1) : _b;
---
<Base lang={lang} title={ja?'ホーム':'Home'}>
{ja ? <>
<h1>日本語の業務文書を扱うAIシステム（<ruby>検索<rt>けんさく</rt></ruby>・情報<ruby>抽出<rt>ちゅうしゅつ</rt></ruby>・安全対策）を開発し、<ruby>精度<rt>せいど</rt></ruby>を数値で<ruby>検証<rt>けんしょう</rt></ruby>しています。</h1>
<p class="en">I build AI systems for Japanese business documents (search, extraction and safety) and check their accuracy with numbers.</p>
<dl class="facts">
<dt>拠点</dt><dd>インド<br><span class="mut">Based: India</span></dd>
<dt>専門</dt><dd>RAG・LLMの評価<br><span class="mut">Focus: RAG / LLM evaluation</span></dd>
<dt>日本語</dt><dd>2026年12月6日にJLPT N2を受験します<br><span class="mut">Japanese: taking JLPT N2 on Dec 6, 2026</span></dd>
<dt>希望</dt><dd>日本でのAI/MLエンジニア職（在留資格「技術・人文知識・国際業務」のスポンサーが必要です）<br><span class="mut">Looking for: AI/ML engineer role in Japan; visa sponsorship (技術・人文知識・国際業務) needed</span></dd>
</dl>
<h2>プロジェクト</h2>
<p class="en">Projects</p>
{projects.map(p => <a class="card" href={`${B}/${lang}/projects/${p.slug}/`}>
{ja ? <><h3 set:html={p.ja.title}/><p class="repo">{p.repo}</p><p class="jp" style="margin:0" set:html={p.ja.line}/><p class="en" style="margin:.2rem 0 0">{p.ja.lineEn}</p></>
 : <><h3>{p.en.title}</h3><p class="repo">{p.repo}</p><p style="margin:0">{p.en.line}</p><ul>{p.en.nums.map(n => <li>{n}</li>)}</ul></>}
</a>)}
<h2>仕事の進め方</h2><p class="en">How I work</p>
<ul>
<li><J tag="span" en="I decide how to measure success before I build.">作る前に、何で成功を測るかを決めます。</J></li>
<li><J tag="span" en="I always show the test size and the weak points with each number.">数字には、テストの件数と弱いところを必ず書きます。</J></li>
<li><J tag="span" en="I work alone. AI agents help with research and drafts; I make the final decisions and checks.">一人で活動しています。調査と下書きはAIエージェントが手伝い、最後の判断とチェックは私が行います。</J></li>
</ul>
<h2><ruby>職務経歴<rt>しょくむけいれき</rt></ruby></h2><p class="en">Experience</p>
<ul class="tl">
<li><time>2024年6月〜</time><span>AIエンジニア（リモート）。大規模言語モデル（LLM）の答えを評価し、安全性をテストする仕事です。<br><span class="mut">Remote AI engineer: I evaluate the answers of large language models and test their safety.</span></span></li>
<li><time>2023年7月〜2024年5月</time><span>個人事業主。データの整理や分析など、小さなデータ・MLの仕事。<br><span class="mut">Self-employed: small data and ML jobs such as data cleaning and analysis.</span></span></li>
<li><time>2026年12月6日</time><span>JLPT N2を受験予定。<br><span class="mut">Preparing for JLPT N2 — Dec 6, 2026</span></span></li>
</ul>
<h2>記事</h2><p class="en">Writing</p>
<J en="Writing starts after the N2 exam.">記事は、N2の試験のあとに始めます。</J>
<h2>連絡先</h2><p class="en">Contact</p>
<J en="Please feel free to contact me on GitHub.">お気軽にGitHubからご連絡ください。</J>
<p><a href="https://github.com/Retro099">github.com/Retro099</a></p>
</> : <>
<h1>I build Japanese-language AI systems — search, extraction and safety checks — and measure whether they work.</h1>
<dl class="facts">
<dt>Based</dt><dd>India</dd>
<dt>Focus</dt><dd>RAG / LLM evaluation</dd>
<dt>Japanese</dt><dd>Taking JLPT N2 on Dec 6, 2026</dd>
<dt>Looking for</dt><dd>AI/ML engineer role in Japan; visa sponsorship (技術・人文知識・国際業務) needed</dd>
</dl>
<h2>Projects</h2>
{projects.map(p => <a class="card" href={`${B}/${lang}/projects/${p.slug}/`}>
{ja ? <><h3 set:html={p.ja.title}/><p class="repo">{p.repo}</p><p class="jp" style="margin:0" set:html={p.ja.line}/><p class="en" style="margin:.2rem 0 0">{p.ja.lineEn}</p></>
 : <><h3>{p.en.title}</h3><p class="repo">{p.repo}</p><p style="margin:0">{p.en.line}</p><ul>{p.en.nums.map(n => <li>{n}</li>)}</ul></>}
</a>)}
<h2>How I work</h2>
<ul>
<li>I decide how success will be measured before I build anything.</li>
<li>Every number comes with its test size and its weak points.</li>
<li>I work alone with AI agents for research and drafts; final decisions and quality checks are mine.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Experience</h2>
<ul class="tl">
<li><time>Jun 2024 –</time><span>Remote AI engineer: I evaluate large language model answers and test their safety.</span></li>
<li><time>Jul 2023 – May 2024</time><span>Self-employed: small data and ML jobs such as data cleaning and analysis.</span></li>
<li><time>Dec 6, 2026</time><span>Preparing for JLPT N2.</span></li>
</ul>
<h2>Writing</h2>
<p class="mut">Writing starts after the N2 exam.</p>
<h2>Contact</h2>
<p>The best way to reach me right now is <a href="https://github.com/Retro099">GitHub</a>.</p>
</>}
</Base>
